      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "This dying message was localized for audiences unfamiliar with Japanese writing systems. Without this change, the underlying mystery - and its solution - would've made zero sense in English (Game: Phoenix Wright - Ace Attorney: Justice For All)",
